TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution custom rate law (k*SA, not limited by time step)
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn   1

RATES
Calcite_kin
-start
10 sa = PARM(1)
20 k  = PARM(2)
30 if (M <= 0) then goto 200
40 rate = k * sa
50 moles = rate
60 if (moles > M) then moles = M
200 SAVE moles
-end

KINETICS 1
    Calcite_kin
        -formula CaCO3 1
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -tol 1e-12
    -steps 10 100

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -step true
    -pH true
END
